title: After escape leaves the caret, save writes every unsaved file and quitting asks nothing
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
expect-file: edit-odd/a.txt :: (?-i)\AAfirst of a\nsecond of a\n\z
expect-file: edit-odd/b.txt :: (?-i)\ABfirst of b\nsecond of b\n\z
expect-file: edit-odd/c.txt :: (?-i)\Afirst of c\nsecond of c\n\z

wait 3000
left files
edit a.txt 1 1
type A
edit b.txt 1 1
type B
key escape
wait 400
mark two-unsaved
wait 400
key save
wait 800
mark none-unsaved
wait 400
quit
